      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Serverless, scales to zero; integrated query caching (Accelerate); real-time database events (Pulse). Built on PostgreSQL (provider = \"postgresql\"); direct TCP connection string preferred for Node.js driver adapter, prisma+postgres:// URL for CLI/Accelerate flows."
